<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Careers — SFIA role explorer</title>
	<%- include('_styles') %>
	<style>
		.home-grid {
			display: grid;
			gap: 12px;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
			margin-top: 14px;
		}
		.home-card {
			background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(48, 64, 108, 0.82) 0%, rgba(30, 44, 80, 0.78) 100%);
			border-radius: var(--radius);
			box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
			backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
			padding: 20px;
			position: relative;
		}
		.home-card::before {
			content: '';
			position: absolute;
			inset: 0;
			border-radius: inherit;
			padding: 2px;
			background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.85), rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.65));
			-webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
			-webkit-mask-composite: xor;
			mask-composite: exclude;
			pointer-events: none;
		}
		.home-card__icon {
			font-size: 28px;
			margin-bottom: 10px;
			line-height: 1;
		}
		.home-card__title {
			font-size: 16px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin: 0 0 6px;
		}
		.home-card__body {
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 13px;
			margin: 0 0 16px;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}
		.home-card__link {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 6px;
			padding: 7px 16px;
			border-radius: 999px;
			border: 1px solid rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.5);
			background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.18);
			color: rgba(236, 233, 255, 0.95);
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 500;
			text-decoration: none;
		}
		.home-card__link:hover {
			background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.30);
			text-decoration: none;
		}
		.home-card__link--teal {
			border-color: rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.5);
			background: rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.12);
			color: rgba(219, 255, 246, 0.95);
		}
		.home-card__link--teal:hover { background: rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.22); }

		.explainer {
			background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(48, 64, 108, 0.82) 0%, rgba(30, 44, 80, 0.78) 100%);
			border-radius: var(--radius);
			box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
			backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
			padding: 22px 24px;
			margin-top: 14px;
			position: relative;
		}
		.explainer::before {
			content: '';
			position: absolute;
			inset: 0;
			border-radius: inherit;
			padding: 2px;
			background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.85), rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.65));
			-webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
			-webkit-mask-composite: xor;
			mask-composite: exclude;
			pointer-events: none;
		}
		.explainer h2 {
			margin: 0 0 12px;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: var(--text);
		}
		.explainer p {
			margin: 0 0 10px;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 13px;
			max-width: 80ch;
			line-height: 1.65;
		}
		.explainer p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
		.explainer strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

		.pill-row {
			display: flex;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			gap: 8px;
			margin: 12px 0;
		}
		.pill {
			padding: 4px 12px;
			border-radius: 999px;
			font-size: 12px;
			border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
			color: var(--muted);
		}
		.pill--purple { border-color: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.5); color: rgba(236, 233, 255, 0.95); background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.12); }
		.pill--teal   { border-color: rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.5);  color: rgba(219, 255, 246, 0.95);  background: rgba(37, 208, 171, 0.10); }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="page">
		<%- include('_nav') %>

		<section class="hero">
			<h1>Career pathways for tech professionals</h1>
			<p>Explore role definitions, required skill levels, and career progression — structured around the SFIA framework. See what's expected at each level, across both individual contributor and management tracks.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="explainer">
			<h2>What is this?</h2>
			<p>
				<strong>SFIA</strong> (Skills Framework for the Information Age) is a globally recognised competency framework for technology professionals. It defines around 120 skills across areas like software development, data management, security, and leadership — each described at up to seven levels of responsibility.
			</p>
			<p>
				This tool maps those skills onto specific roles, so you can answer questions like: <em>what does a Senior Engineer actually need to be able to do?</em> or <em>how does the expectation change when I move into a line management track?</em>
			</p>
			<h2>How to use it</h2>
			<p>
				Start with <strong>Roles</strong> — pick a role and a level (1 = entry, 7 = executive) to see which SFIA skills are required and at what proficiency. Each role has two pathways:
			</p>
			<div class="pill-row">
				<span class="pill pill--purple">IC — Individual Contributor</span>
				<span class="pill pill--teal">LM — Line Manager</span>
			</div>
			<p>
				If you want to understand a specific skill in depth, browse <strong>Skills</strong> to see its description at every SFIA level. The <strong>SFIA CSV</strong> view shows the raw framework data if you need it.
			</p>
			<p>
				On any role–level page you can <strong>vote</strong> to suggest a different required level for a skill, or propose adding or removing a skill entirely. Votes are anonymous and help refine the role definitions over time.
			</p>
		</section>

		<div class="home-grid">
			<div class="home-card">
				<div class="home-card__icon">🗂</div>
				<div class="home-card__title">Roles</div>
				<div class="home-card__body">Browse all roles across IC and LM pathways. Select a level to see exactly which skills are required and at what depth.</div>
				<a href="/roles" class="home-card__link">Browse roles →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="home-card">
				<div class="home-card__icon">🔬</div>
				<div class="home-card__title">Skills</div>
				<div class="home-card__body">Explore individual SFIA skills — what each one means and how the expectation scales from level 1 through 7.</div>
				<a href="/skills" class="home-card__link home-card__link--teal">Browse skills →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="home-card">
				<div class="home-card__icon">📄</div>
				<div class="home-card__title">SFIA framework</div>
				<div class="home-card__body">View the underlying SFIA CSV data — all skill categories, codes, and level descriptions as defined in SFIA 8.</div>
				<a href="/sfia/" class="home-card__link">View SFIA data →</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<%- include('_footer') %>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
